id=\"features\" class=\"py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6\"><div class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-accent\">核心功能</span><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl\">让素材管理更清晰，让片段定位更高效</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-pretty text-muted-foreground\">Meta Player 把项目管理、素材导入、视频播放、AI 剧情大纲提取、剧情检索和关键时间点标记整合到一个桌面应用中。</p></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-card/80\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-kanban h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 20h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7.93a2 2 0 0 1-1.66-.9l-.82-1.2A2 2 0 0 0 7.93 3H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13c0 1.1.9 2 2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M8 10v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 10v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 10v6\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">项目化管理</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">按项目组织素材与分析结果，支持新建、编辑、删除和搜索项目，快速切换不同工作台。</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-card/80\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-upload h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v12\"></path><path d=\"m17 8-5-5-5 5\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">本地素材导入</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">批量导入本地视频和图片，支持托管和引用两种模式，内容哈希去重避免重复入库。</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-card/80\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-play h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 9.003a1 1 0 0 1 1.517-.859l4.997 2.997a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.718l-4.997 2.997A1 1 0 0 1 9 14.996z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">视频播放与定位</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">桌面端本地视频播放，支持跳转到指定时间点，与剧情检索、标记结果联动定位。</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-card/80\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 18V5\"></path><path d=\"M15 13a4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3-4 4.17 4.17 0 0 1-3 4\"></path><path d=\"M17.598 6.5A3 3 0 1 0 12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.598 1.5\"></path><path d=\"M17.997 5.125a4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77\"></path><path d=\"M18 18a4 4 0 0 0 2-7.464\"></path><path d=\"M19.967 17.483A4 4 0 1 1 12 18a4 4 0 1 1-7.967-.517\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-2-7.464\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125a4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">AI 剧情大纲</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">基于素材简介和字幕文本调用 AI 接口，自动提取结构化剧情场景，一键定位视频片段。</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-card/80\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">剧情检索</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">关键词检索剧情片段，支持 Embedding 检索和大模型排序，搜索结果一键跳转对应时间。</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6 transition-all hover:border-accent/50 hover:bg-card/80\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-accent-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bookmark h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v15a1 1 0 0 1-1.496.868l-4.512-2.578a2 2 0 0 0-1.984 0l-4.512 2.578A1 1 0 0 1 5 20V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">标记与审片</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">为素材添加、编辑、删除标记，点击标记回看对应时间点，支持标记时间微调。</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"scenarios\" class=\"border-t border-border bg-secondary/30 py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6\"><div class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-accent\">适用场景</span><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl\">面对长视频、素材多、信息散的问题</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-pretty text-muted-foreground\">从“拖时间轴找内容”变成“看大纲、搜剧情、点结果直接跳转”。</p></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex gap-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-film h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 3v18\"></path><path d=\"M3 7.5h4\"></path><path d=\"M3 12h18\"></path><path d=\"M3 16.5h4\"></path><path d=\"M17 3v18\"></path><path d=\"M17 7.5h4\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5h4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">长视频内容整理</h3><p class=\"mb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">节目、短剧、访谈、课程等长视频内容的系统化整理和管理。</p><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">按项目组织素材</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">统一维护简介</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">管理分析结果</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">审片与回看</h3><p class=\"mb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">高效审核视频内容，快速标记和回看关键时间点。</p><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">标记关键时间点</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">点击直接跳转</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">时间微调功能</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-search h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><circle cx=\"11.5\" cy=\"14.5\" r=\"2.5\"></circle><path d=\"M13.3 16.3 15 18\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">片段快速回查</h3><p class=\"mb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">根据剧情、字幕或描述快速定位和回查视频片段。</p><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">AI 剧情大纲</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">关键词检索</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Embedding 语义搜索</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent/10 text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scissors h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M8.12 8.12 12 12\"></path><path d=\"M20 4 8.12 15.88\"></path><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M14.8 14.8 20 20\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">素材结构化准备</h3><p class=\"mb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">为后续剪辑、切片和内容复用做结构化准备。</p><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">场景标题描述</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">起止时间标注</li><li class=\"rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">结构化导出</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"workflow\" class=\"py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6\"><div class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-accent\">工作流程</span><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-balance text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl\">四步开启高效视频管理</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-pretty text-muted-foreground\">简洁直观的操作流程，让你快速上手并发挥 Meta Player 的全部潜力。</p></div><div class=\"mt-16\"><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-accent\">01</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right hidden h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground md:absolute md:right-0 md:top-8 md:block md:translate-x-1/2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">创建项目</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">新建一个项目来组织你的视频素材和分析结果。</p></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-accent\">02</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right hidden h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground md:absolute md:right-0 md:top-8 md:block md:translate-x-1/2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">导入素材</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">批量导入本地视频文件，添加简介和字幕文本。</p></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-accent\">03</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right hidden h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground md:absolute md:right-0 md:top-8 md:block md:translate-x-1/2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">AI 分析</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">一键提取结构化剧情大纲，自动生成场景时间点。</p></div></div><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-accent\">04</span></div><h3 class=\"mb-2 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground\">检索定位</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">通过大纲浏览或关键词搜索，一键跳转到目标片段。</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-border bg-card\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"border-b border-border p-8 md:border-r md:border-b-0\"><div class=\"mb-6 inline-block rounded-full bg-destructive/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-destructive\">传统方式</div><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground\">拖时间轴找内容</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground\"></span>手动拖拽进度条，反复寻找目标片段。</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground\"></span>素材散落各处，缺乏统一管理。</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-muted-foreground\"></span>记忆依赖人脑，容易遗漏关键点。</li></ul></div><div class=\"p-8\"><div class=\"mb-6 inline-block rounded-full bg-accent/10 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-accent\">Meta Player</div><h3 class=\"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-foreground\">看大纲、搜剧情、点击跳转</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 text-muted-foreground\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span>AI 自动提取剧情大纲，场景一目了然。</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span>项目化管理，素材、字幕、分析结果统一维护。</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span>关键词搜索加语义检索，精准定位目标。</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section>